# payments

Apply the payments skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- apply payments methods within explicit integrations boundaries
- analyze design payment flows as a high-trust seam with explicit failure, reconciliation, webhooks, idempotency, pci dss, and rollback posture — with stripe, adyen, or equivalent with assumptions, constraints, and failure modes
- produce and validate a integrations artifact with evidence, decisions, and next steps

Stop when: Stop only when each money movement has an authoritative state machine, immutable ledger postings, replay/idempotency strategy, settlement and reconciliation owner, fraud/approval outcome, compensation path, and evidence boundary; stop as blocked on amount/currency mismatch, unverifiable webhook, unresolved ledger discrepancy, unsafe failover, or missing approval.
